Definition, classification, and extent of problem</article-title><source>Am J Drug Alcohol Abuse</source><year>1976</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>279</fpage><lpage>292</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1032742</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.3109/00952997609077197</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Staines</surname><given-names>GL</given-names></name><name><surname>Magura</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Foote</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Deluca</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kosanke</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Polysubstance use among alcoholics</article-title><source>J Addict Dis</source><year>2001</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>53</fpage><lpage>69</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11760926</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1300/J069v20n04_06</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>NS</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Frances RJ, Miller SI</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Special problems of the alcohol and multiple-drug dependent: Clinical interactions and detoxification</article-title><source>Clinical Textbook of Addictive Disorders</source><year>1998</year><publisher-name>New York: The Guilford Press</publisher-name><fpage>262</fpage><lpage>288</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Darke</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Hall</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Levels and correlates of polydrug use among heroin users and regular amphetamine users</article-title><source>Drug Alcohol Depend</source><year>1995</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>231</fpage><lpage>235</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8556972</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0376-8716(95)01171-9</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Leri</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Stewart</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Tremblay</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Bruneau</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Heroin and cocaine co-use in a group of injection drug users in Montreal</article-title><source>J Psychiatry Neurosci</source><year>2004</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>40</fpage><lpage>47</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14719049</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Leri</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Bruneau</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Stewart</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Understanding polydrug use: Review of heroin and cocaine co-use</article-title><source>Addiction</source><year>2003</year><volume>98</volume><fpage>7</fpage><lpage>22</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12492751</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1360-0443.2003.00236.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jaffe</surname><given-names>LT</given-names></name><name><surname>Archer</surname><given-names>RP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The prediction of drug use among college students from MMPI, MCMI, and sensation seeking scales</article-title><source>J Pers Assess</source><year>1987</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>243</fpage><lpage>253</lpage><comment>Summer</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3598842</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-t